.18, "text": " continuing a project that isn't working."}, {"start": 59.62, "end": 62.22, "text": " The more you've invested, the harder it is to stop."}, {"start": 62.88, "end": 63.98, "text": " So how do you get out?"}, {"start": 64.52, "end": 66.04, "text": " First, ask the right question."}, {"start": 66.58, "end": 69.36, "text": " If I hadn't paid anything yet, would I do this today?"}, {"start": 69.84, "end": 71.44, "text": " If the answer is no, stop."}, {"start": 72.16, "end": 73.8, "text": " Then count the future cost."}, {"start": 74.36, "end": 76.54, "text": " Each extra month is $40 more."}, {"start": 77.14, "end": 79.94, "text": " The past is gone, but the future, you can still save."}, {"start": 80.34, "end": 81.86, "text": " Every month is a new decision."}, {"start": 82.48, "end": 84.66, "text": " Finally, turn the loss into a lesson."}, {"start": 85.17999999999999, "end": 87.36, "text": " What you've already paid is the price of learning"}, {"start": 87.36, "end": 88.32, "text": " it didn't suit you."}, {"start": 88.92, "end": 90.92, "text": " And you, which subscription are you paying for"}, {"start": 90.92, "end": 91.72, "text": " without using it?"}, {"start": 92.06, "end": 92.74, "text": " Tell us in the comments."}], "aligned_to_script": true}